00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:14,740
( Watch on Kissasia.vip )

1
00:01:37,105 --> 00:01:40,081
[Episode 1]

2
00:01:54,105 --> 00:01:58,731
[North Slope Inn]

3
00:02:18,517 --> 00:02:20,045
Waiter, a pot of liquor!

4
00:02:20,045 --> 00:02:21,685
Right away!

5
00:02:24,836 --> 00:02:25,867
Master,

6
00:02:25,867 --> 00:02:27,418
two pots of liquor over there.

7
00:02:27,418 --> 00:02:29,188
Let them.

8
00:02:48,278 --> 00:02:50,199
Da Hai, stop eating.

9
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:52,050
We need to get moving.

10
00:02:52,050 --> 00:02:53,430
Third Chief,

11
00:02:53,430 --> 00:02:55,203
it's raining so hard. What's the hurry?

12
00:02:55,203 --> 00:02:56,963
Move even if it rains knives,

13
00:02:56,963 --> 00:02:58,450
now with something this important.

14
00:02:58,450 --> 00:02:59,744
Can't risk any delays.

15
00:02:59,744 --> 00:03:00,797
Just one more bite.

16
00:03:00,797 --> 00:03:02,342
At least wait until I'm done.

17
00:04:18,264 --> 00:04:20,532
Are you the Third Chief of Shengyun Stronghold,

18
00:04:20,532 --> 00:04:22,592
Ge Yun Fei?

19
00:04:23,964 --> 00:04:25,055
Leave it,

20
00:04:25,055 --> 00:04:26,182
and you'll have your lives.

21
00:04:26,182 --> 00:04:28,315
You know who I am,

22
00:04:28,315 --> 00:04:30,892
yet you dare to take what's mine?

23
00:04:30,892 --> 00:04:32,298
If you can steal it,

24
00:04:32,298 --> 00:04:34,725
so can we.

25
00:04:36,632 --> 00:04:38,498
You dare challenge Shengyun Stronghold?

26
00:04:38,498 --> 00:04:40,496
You must want to die!

27
00:04:42,065 --> 00:04:43,856
Da Hai!

28
00:04:47,398 --> 00:04:49,397
The Tang Sect.

29
00:04:50,185 --> 00:04:52,291
[Tang Jiu Jue,
from Wuning Hall of the Tang Sect]

30
00:04:56,545 --> 00:04:58,705
You're dead!

31
00:06:16,345 --> 00:06:17,905
Watch out!

32
00:06:52,565 --> 00:06:54,205
Are you okay?

33
00:07:08,405 --> 00:07:10,325
Are you wounded?

34
00:07:21,405 --> 00:07:23,325
Who did this to you?

35
00:07:27,245 --> 00:07:29,298
Can't speak?

36
00:07:29,298 --> 00:07:30,633
But you can hear me,

37
00:07:30,633 --> 00:07:32,344
right?

38
00:07:37,632 --> 00:07:40,485
When I find the one who did this,

39
00:07:40,485 --> 00:07:42,365
I'll make him pay.

40
00:07:56,765 --> 00:07:58,900
It seems to like you a lot.

41
00:08:05,255 --> 00:08:08,005
That's weird. The herbs on you...

42
00:08:08,005 --> 00:08:10,485
It shouldn't like that smell.

43
00:08:20,805 --> 00:08:22,808
All from Shengyun Stronghold are dead.

44
00:08:22,808 --> 00:08:24,696
How will you get back there?

45
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:28,346
You're not from Shengyun Stronghold.

46
00:08:29,565 --> 00:08:30,725
How about this?

47
00:08:30,725 --> 00:08:32,525
Xiangyang is the closest city.

48
00:08:32,525 --> 00:08:34,005
I'll find someone to take you there,

49
00:08:34,005 --> 00:08:36,365
and then have the authorities step in.

50
00:08:38,005 --> 00:08:39,485
Master.

51
00:08:42,965 --> 00:08:44,605
They're back.

52
00:08:52,005 --> 00:08:54,445
Why are you back here?

53
00:08:54,445 --> 00:08:57,965
The child has it. Search him.

54
00:08:57,965 --> 00:08:59,205
Are you blind?

55
00:08:59,205 --> 00:09:00,632
He's dressed so lightly.

56
00:09:00,632 --> 00:09:01,665
Where could he hide anything?

57
00:09:01,665 --> 00:09:02,998
If it's not on him,

58
00:09:02,998 --> 00:09:05,198
then it must be on you.

59
00:09:14,198 --> 00:09:15,831
Cushion Palm, impressive.

60
00:09:15,831 --> 00:09:17,165
You've had your fun with me.

61
00:09:17,165 --> 00:09:18,917
But with the child?

62
00:09:18,917 --> 00:09:21,632
That would stain Tang Sect Wuning Hall.

63
00:09:21,632 --> 00:09:23,416
Who are you?

64
00:09:25,525 --> 00:09:26,581
You...

65
00:09:26,581 --> 00:09:28,393
rank second on the list.

66
00:09:29,431 --> 00:09:31,265
The other two are ranked too low,

67
00:09:31,265 --> 00:09:34,365
I can't remember them.
Who is allowed to see the Longhu List?

68
00:09:34,365 --> 00:09:35,865
You should know that very well.

69
00:09:35,865 --> 00:09:37,965
Since you are a friend rather than a foe,

70
00:09:37,965 --> 00:09:39,198
please do us a favor.

71
00:09:39,198 --> 00:09:40,199
Step aside. We're taking back

72
00:09:40,199 --> 00:09:41,566
what belongs to the Tang Sect.

73
00:09:41,566 --> 00:09:43,365
Belongs to the Tang Sect?

74
00:09:43,365 --> 00:09:44,725
If it belongs to the Tang Sect,

75
00:09:44,725 --> 00:09:46,505
why is it at Shengyun Stronghold?

76
00:09:46,505 --> 00:09:47,765
I'm sure you're aware

77
00:09:47,765 --> 00:09:48,965
that the Tang Sect and the Shengyun Stronghold

78
00:09:48,965 --> 00:09:49,966
have a long-standing feud.

79
00:09:49,966 --> 00:09:51,765
The reasons behind today's events

80
00:09:51,765 --> 00:09:53,765
can't be shared with an outsider.

81
00:09:54,385 --> 00:09:56,642
Then what does this thing look like?

82
00:09:56,642 --> 00:09:59,333
What marks does it bear? Tell me about it.

83
00:09:59,333 --> 00:10:01,749
You came looking for it and you don't even know

84
00:10:01,749 --> 00:10:03,699
what it looks like?

85
00:10:05,098 --> 00:10:07,032
- It's fine.
- If you keep interfering,

86
00:10:07,032 --> 00:10:09,525
the entire Tang Sect will make sure

87
00:10:09,525 --> 00:10:11,565
you never have peace again.

88
00:10:14,798 --> 00:10:17,431
Then ask Tang Tian Hao if it's okay.

89
00:10:17,431 --> 00:10:20,805
He has never dared to speak to me like that.

90
00:10:20,805 --> 00:10:24,505
From where I stand,
that thing doesn't belong to Tang Sect at all.

91
00:10:24,505 --> 00:10:26,445
That's why you can't say what it is.

92
00:10:26,445 --> 00:10:27,565
Or maybe...

93
00:10:27,565 --> 00:10:29,799
it's something foul

94
00:10:29,799 --> 00:10:32,485
and would burn your tongue to just name it.

95
00:10:32,485 --> 00:10:35,245
You really want to know?

96
00:10:43,748 --> 00:10:45,298
It's just that

97
00:10:45,298 --> 00:10:47,232
once you know,

98
00:10:47,232 --> 00:10:49,498
you die!

99
00:10:52,831 --> 00:10:55,398
You must be the Chief of Shengyun Stronghold,

100
00:10:55,398 --> 00:10:57,298
Jiao Chao Gui,

101
00:10:57,298 --> 00:10:59,098
and the Second Chief, Mu Xiu Quan.

102
00:10:59,098 --> 00:11:01,297
Who killed Ge Yun Fei?

103
00:11:02,065 --> 00:11:03,431
It has nothing to do with us.

104
00:11:03,431 --> 00:11:04,598
Concerning the death of your Third Chief,

105
00:11:04,598 --> 00:11:06,632
and the whereabouts of that object,

106
00:11:06,632 --> 00:11:08,165
those three can tell you everything.

107
00:11:49,445 --> 00:11:52,405
What an unlucky day this is.

108
00:12:05,831 --> 00:12:07,125
No way.

109
00:12:07,125 --> 00:12:08,165
Shengyun Stronghold

110
00:12:08,165 --> 00:12:10,325
has suffered so much from the Tang Sect.

111
00:12:10,325 --> 00:12:12,483
Why are they still so reckless?

112
00:12:31,045 --> 00:12:32,215
Don't get me wrong.

113
00:12:32,215 --> 00:12:33,885
I know the rules.

114
00:12:33,885 --> 00:12:35,198
I'm not helping anyone.

115
00:12:35,198 --> 00:12:37,585
My apologies. Go on.

116
00:12:47,765 --> 00:12:49,725
I've already apologized to you.

117
00:12:49,725 --> 00:12:51,385
Why must you still attack me?

118
00:12:51,385 --> 00:12:52,432
How is this possible?

119
00:12:52,432 --> 00:12:54,732
Nothing gets through the Cushion Palm!

120
00:12:56,025 --> 00:12:58,305
Something's wrong. Go!

121
00:13:04,482 --> 00:13:07,014
You must be from Linglong Manor.

122
00:13:07,631 --> 00:13:09,215
Since you're from the Huo family,

123
00:13:09,215 --> 00:13:11,065
thank you for your help.

124
00:13:11,065 --> 00:13:12,799
We'll take the child now.

125
00:13:12,799 --> 00:13:16,517
No need. I wasn't meant to help you.

126
00:13:16,517 --> 00:13:18,765
This child is not from Shengyun Stronghold.

127
00:13:18,765 --> 00:13:20,832
You can't take him away.

128
00:13:20,832 --> 00:13:23,556
Since you insist on meddling,

129
00:13:23,556 --> 00:13:27,331
then I have to offend the Huo family!

130
00:14:12,647 --> 00:14:14,566
This between you and Tang Sect isn't over.

131
00:14:14,566 --> 00:14:17,600
I'll come back for you.

132
00:14:37,045 --> 00:14:38,903
Where are you going?

133
00:14:43,965 --> 00:14:45,762
Xiangyang?

134
00:14:48,398 --> 00:14:49,962
Let me take you there.

135
00:14:51,525 --> 00:14:53,607
Are you going alone?

136
00:14:54,956 --> 00:14:57,832
I've made myself a fair bit of trouble.

137
00:14:57,832 --> 00:14:59,805
I'm afraid if I go to Xiangyang with you,

138
00:14:59,805 --> 00:15:01,685
I'll put you in danger.

139
00:15:07,445 --> 00:15:09,325
Wait.

140
00:15:10,365 --> 00:15:11,685
Let me take you there.

141
00:15:11,685 --> 00:15:13,005
It's too dangerous.

142
00:15:13,005 --> 00:15:14,845
There's blood on your clothes.

143
00:15:14,845 --> 00:15:16,165
It stands out.

144
00:15:16,165 --> 00:15:19,925
Wait for me. Let me find you some new clothes.

145
00:15:19,925 --> 00:15:21,805
Wait for me!

146
00:15:21,805 --> 00:15:23,776
I'll be right back.

147
00:15:24,347 --> 00:15:26,357
Don't leave!

148
00:15:32,293 --> 00:15:34,465
These two pants might be a bit long for you,

149
00:15:34,465 --> 00:15:35,775
but...

150
00:15:38,165 --> 00:15:39,666
Where is he?

151
00:16:23,085 --> 00:16:24,281
[Feng Shao, military envoy
of the Xiangzhou (cavalry and infantry)]

152
00:16:24,281 --> 00:16:25,982
No one flees the watch

153
00:16:25,982 --> 00:16:28,085
unless they have a guilty conscience.

154
00:16:28,085 --> 00:16:29,165
Take him back.

155
00:16:29,165 --> 00:16:31,405
Question him properly there.

156
00:16:37,398 --> 00:16:40,465
Cai! Make some hot ginger soup.

157
00:16:46,845 --> 00:16:48,365
Here.

158
00:16:54,683 --> 00:16:56,125
Cai! Get out here!

159
00:16:56,125 --> 00:16:58,698
Master Feng.

160
00:16:58,698 --> 00:17:00,232
You're finally here.

161
00:17:00,232 --> 00:17:02,725
I came close to summoning the guards.

162
00:17:02,725 --> 00:17:05,295
What happened?
Why are there so many dead bodies?

163
00:17:05,295 --> 00:17:06,365
Don't just look here.

164
00:17:06,365 --> 00:17:09,164
There's another one pinned inside.

165
00:17:14,645 --> 00:17:17,105
Master Feng, look.

166
00:17:17,105 --> 00:17:18,705
Look at this.

167
00:17:24,165 --> 00:17:25,166
Who did this?

168
00:17:25,166 --> 00:17:26,815
I have no idea.

169
00:17:28,098 --> 00:17:29,165
What about the four outside?

170
00:17:29,165 --> 00:17:30,765
I don't know them.

171
00:17:30,765 --> 00:17:32,265
You bastard, are you playing with me?

172
00:17:32,265 --> 00:17:34,232
I wouldn't dare. The ones outside were killed

173
00:17:34,232 --> 00:17:35,298
by three men in black.

174
00:17:35,298 --> 00:17:36,765
They fled right after the kill.

175
00:17:36,765 --> 00:17:38,298
I don't know who they are.

176
00:17:38,298 --> 00:17:40,525
As for this one, I have no idea how he died.

177
00:17:40,525 --> 00:17:44,298
So, killers are not our targets.

178
00:17:44,298 --> 00:17:46,264
Send the signal.

179
00:17:54,885 --> 00:17:57,198
Master Feng, who was that signal for?

180
00:17:57,198 --> 00:17:58,914
If there are other guests arriving,

181
00:17:58,914 --> 00:18:01,565
I shall receive them promptly.

182
00:18:01,565 --> 00:18:03,598
Who was it for?

183
00:18:03,598 --> 00:18:05,898
My superior, of course.

184
00:18:05,898 --> 00:18:08,665
Commandant of the Xiangzhou Prefecture
Cavalry and Infantry,

185
00:18:08,665 --> 00:18:11,081
Master Shao Ji Zu.

186
00:18:22,445 --> 00:18:25,441
[Yicheng County]

187
00:18:38,798 --> 00:18:40,419
Commander Shao.

188
00:18:41,381 --> 00:18:43,698
Did you find the suspect?

189
00:18:43,698 --> 00:18:45,298
It's unclear if he's the suspect,

190
00:18:45,298 --> 00:18:47,930
but I found something weird.

191
00:18:57,964 --> 00:18:59,365
The wounds on these men

192
00:18:59,365 --> 00:19:01,565
are clearly from blades, not swords.

193
00:19:01,565 --> 00:19:03,498
And they died of poisoning.

194
00:19:03,498 --> 00:19:05,965
It must be the Tang Sect.

195
00:19:05,965 --> 00:19:08,045
Did you not see it,

196
00:19:09,285 --> 00:19:11,725
or did you not even look?

197
00:19:11,725 --> 00:19:13,460
What I don't understand is

198
00:19:13,460 --> 00:19:15,085
why the Tang Sect people were here.

199
00:19:15,085 --> 00:19:17,803
Were they also here for that person?

200
00:19:17,803 --> 00:19:19,932
They've been assigned to other matters.

201
00:19:22,198 --> 00:19:23,232
Inside,

202
00:19:23,232 --> 00:19:24,498
there's another body.

203
00:19:40,764 --> 00:19:42,799
Turn this place apart.

204
00:19:42,799 --> 00:19:44,198
Don't miss any single corner.

205
00:19:44,198 --> 00:19:45,398
Yes!

206
00:20:32,998 --> 00:20:35,570
Be careful. Don't make a sound.

207
00:20:37,032 --> 00:20:38,670
Who are you?

208
00:20:47,432 --> 00:20:49,355
Watch out!

209
00:20:50,672 --> 00:20:53,525
Was that you catching
Ge Yun Fei's Throwing Halberd?

210
00:20:53,525 --> 00:20:55,965
Cai, are you certain no one is hiding here?

211
00:20:55,965 --> 00:20:58,298
Master Feng,
you can see all the rooms I have here.

212
00:20:58,298 --> 00:20:59,831
Definitely no one is hiding here.

213
00:20:59,831 --> 00:21:01,165
Commander Shao had said

214
00:21:01,165 --> 00:21:02,798
that we can't miss any single corner.

215
00:21:02,798 --> 00:21:04,831
If we find anything,

216
00:21:04,831 --> 00:21:06,805
you won't like what happens next.

217
00:21:11,065 --> 00:21:12,645
Master Feng,

218
00:21:12,645 --> 00:21:14,245
is that Master Shao?

219
00:21:14,245 --> 00:21:15,998
He's so young.

220
00:21:15,998 --> 00:21:17,431
So handsome.

221
00:21:17,431 --> 00:21:18,432
He looks so impressive.

222
00:21:18,432 --> 00:21:20,033
Of course.

223
00:21:20,033 --> 00:21:22,649
The peace in Xiangzhou

224
00:21:22,649 --> 00:21:24,725
is all thanks to him.

225
00:21:24,725 --> 00:21:26,350
Even the Lord of Xiangyang

226
00:21:26,350 --> 00:21:28,898
thinks very highly of him,

227
00:21:28,898 --> 00:21:32,281
and arranged a marriage between him
and the eldest daughter of the Linglong Manor.

228
00:21:32,281 --> 00:21:35,314
The wedding is in a few days.

229
00:21:38,606 --> 00:21:40,353
- Commander Shao.
- Anything unusual?

230
00:21:40,353 --> 00:21:42,165
We've searched everywhere. Nothing.

231
00:21:42,165 --> 00:21:43,365
Even the courtyard?

232
00:21:43,365 --> 00:21:44,725
Yes.

233
00:21:48,416 --> 00:21:50,265
Watch this.

234
00:21:50,265 --> 00:21:52,208
Have you seen this man?

235
00:21:53,125 --> 00:21:54,698
No.

236
00:21:54,698 --> 00:21:56,641
Take a good look.

237
00:22:02,325 --> 00:22:03,583
Commander Shao.

238
00:22:03,583 --> 00:22:04,685
I might have seen him.

239
00:22:04,685 --> 00:22:05,848
When?

240
00:22:05,848 --> 00:22:07,445
I can't quite remember.

241
00:22:07,445 --> 00:22:09,365
A day or two ago, maybe.

242
00:22:09,365 --> 00:22:10,865
Before the killing outside.

243
00:22:10,865 --> 00:22:13,005
He'd already left.

244
00:22:13,005 --> 00:22:14,325
Which direction?

245
00:22:14,325 --> 00:22:16,565
I really don't know that.

246
00:22:18,259 --> 00:22:21,565
Then search your memory. Carefully.

247
00:22:21,565 --> 00:22:23,461
If you remember anything, come and see me.

248
00:22:23,461 --> 00:22:25,052
There will be a handsome reward.

249
00:22:25,052 --> 00:22:26,831
I certainly will.

250
00:22:26,831 --> 00:22:28,725
If I may ask.

251
00:22:28,725 --> 00:22:30,445
Who is this man?

252
00:22:30,445 --> 00:22:32,565
Why commit so many guards to the capture?

253
00:22:32,565 --> 00:22:34,405
He's rather comely.

254
00:22:34,405 --> 00:22:37,245
Is he even more terrifying
than the ones who kill those five?

255
00:22:37,245 --> 00:22:39,085
This man is a cold-blooded killer.

256
00:22:39,085 --> 00:22:40,631
Five?

257
00:22:40,631 --> 00:22:42,685
He even killed fifty.

258
00:22:42,685 --> 00:22:44,065
So,

259
00:22:44,065 --> 00:22:47,465
don't let that face fool you.

260
00:22:47,465 --> 00:22:49,098
Commander Shao, don't worry.

261
00:22:49,098 --> 00:22:50,998
I'll tell you as soon as I see him.

262
00:22:50,998 --> 00:22:52,848
I won't let him get away.

263
00:23:07,598 --> 00:23:09,365
I may be mistaken.

264
00:23:09,365 --> 00:23:10,736
Perhaps this death

265
00:23:10,736 --> 00:23:12,665
was not the work of the Tang Sect.

266
00:23:12,665 --> 00:23:14,325
That fatal wound?

267
00:23:14,325 --> 00:23:16,861
It was the Tang Sect's poison, of course.

268
00:23:16,861 --> 00:23:18,698
But what's interesting

269
00:23:18,698 --> 00:23:21,703
is this short halberd in his chest.

270
00:23:42,445 --> 00:23:44,053
Wait.

271
00:24:07,665 --> 00:24:09,798
Could it be that this sword was broken

272
00:24:09,798 --> 00:24:12,183
by this short halberd?

273
00:24:12,183 --> 00:24:13,766
- Innkeeper.
- I'm here.

274
00:24:13,766 --> 00:24:15,483
Master.

275
00:24:16,564 --> 00:24:18,626
Whose sword is this?

276
00:24:18,626 --> 00:24:21,916
I heard they called him Master Jiao.

277
00:24:24,685 --> 00:24:28,553
This man threw the short halberd,

278
00:24:28,553 --> 00:24:30,685
striking Jiao Chao Gui's sword.

279
00:24:30,685 --> 00:24:33,085
Then the short halberd changed course,

280
00:24:33,085 --> 00:24:34,845
and struck Mu Xiu Quan.

281
00:24:34,845 --> 00:24:36,765
What an exquisite strike.

282
00:24:36,765 --> 00:24:40,125
His martial arts must be extraordinary.

283
00:24:40,125 --> 00:24:43,651
If his martial arts are truly that formidable,

284
00:24:45,365 --> 00:24:48,128
why didn't he just kill them?

285
00:24:49,485 --> 00:24:51,325
Why did he just use redirection

286
00:24:51,325 --> 00:24:53,565
and finesse against them?

287
00:24:53,565 --> 00:24:55,032
Unless...

288
00:24:55,032 --> 00:24:58,098
he's hiding his true style.

289
00:24:59,265 --> 00:25:01,698
There's another possibility.

290
00:25:01,698 --> 00:25:05,098
He lacks the strength for anything stronger.

291
00:25:05,098 --> 00:25:07,065
He must prevail through subtlety.

292
00:25:11,685 --> 00:25:13,365
There are only three water routes

293
00:25:13,365 --> 00:25:16,298
and two land routes to leave Xiangzhou.

294
00:25:16,298 --> 00:25:18,139
Issue a strict order.

295
00:25:18,139 --> 00:25:20,432
Secure every crossing, every post house.

296
00:25:20,432 --> 00:25:21,898
Horse markets must also be closed.

297
00:25:21,898 --> 00:25:24,398
All we need to do is guard every location

298
00:25:24,398 --> 00:25:26,165
and strictly inspect all passersby.

299
00:25:26,165 --> 00:25:27,965
Even if he wants to leave,

300
00:25:27,965 --> 00:25:30,232
he can't.

301
00:25:30,232 --> 00:25:32,098
That damn Shao Ji Zu.

302
00:25:32,098 --> 00:25:33,665
So ruthless.

303
00:25:40,098 --> 00:25:41,838
They're gone.

304
00:25:47,098 --> 00:25:48,596
Wait.

305
00:25:49,198 --> 00:25:50,598
Who exactly are you?

306
00:25:50,598 --> 00:25:52,198
A nobody.

307
00:25:52,198 --> 00:25:54,485
My name is not worth mentioning.

308
00:25:54,485 --> 00:25:56,565
Who are you hiding from

309
00:25:56,565 --> 00:25:57,645
by staying here?

310
00:25:57,645 --> 00:25:59,722
Holding a divine weapon, Yin Yang An,

311
00:25:59,722 --> 00:26:01,941
showing a superb lightness skill,
A Fleeting Glimpse,

312
00:26:01,941 --> 00:26:04,445
possessing the skill of
The Silent World Within Earshot.

313
00:26:04,445 --> 00:26:06,298
You can hear voices from a hundred paces away.

314
00:26:06,298 --> 00:26:07,364
I presume

315
00:26:07,364 --> 00:26:09,598
you are from Linglong Manor.

316
00:26:09,598 --> 00:26:12,347
You can recognize my lightness skill?

317
00:26:15,365 --> 00:26:18,348
Wait, how do you recognize the Yin Yang An?

318
00:26:19,398 --> 00:26:20,845
I've spent a lot of time in the martial world.

319
00:26:20,845 --> 00:26:23,498
I heard a thing or two about its history.

320
00:26:23,498 --> 00:26:26,032
The Yin Yang An is forged from the Ink Fire.

321
00:26:26,032 --> 00:26:27,665
It specifically counters cold martial arts.

322
00:26:27,665 --> 00:26:28,965
The Cushion Palm of Wuning Hall

323
00:26:28,965 --> 00:26:30,865
was unaffected by Jiao's and Mu's swords,

324
00:26:30,865 --> 00:26:32,432
yet pierced by yours.

325
00:26:32,432 --> 00:26:33,665
Such a divine weapon...

326
00:26:33,665 --> 00:26:36,699
The stories don't do it justice.

327
00:26:36,699 --> 00:26:38,298
Keen eyes.

328
00:26:38,298 --> 00:26:39,705
Since you've figured it out,

329
00:26:39,705 --> 00:26:41,631
I have nothing to hide.

330
00:26:41,631 --> 00:26:44,125
I am from Linglong Manor.

331
00:26:44,125 --> 00:26:45,845
[Huo Xiao Di, a disciple of Linglong Manor]
I'm Huo Xiao Di,

332
00:26:45,845 --> 00:26:48,565
ranking lowest in Linglong Manor.

333
00:26:49,665 --> 00:26:50,865
It seems that

334
00:26:50,865 --> 00:26:52,998
Linglong Manor's standing

335
00:26:52,998 --> 00:26:55,163
is much higher than I thought.

336
00:26:55,163 --> 00:26:56,498
Even its lowest-ranking disciple

337
00:26:56,498 --> 00:26:58,325
can call the Tang Sect's young master

338
00:26:58,325 --> 00:27:00,605
and the provincial general by name.

339
00:27:01,432 --> 00:27:04,765
Don't dodge my question.

340
00:27:04,765 --> 00:27:06,398
I've told you my name.

341
00:27:06,398 --> 00:27:08,115
Your turn now.

342
00:27:16,765 --> 00:27:19,559
[Zhan Ri Fei, a knight-errant]
Surname Zhan, given name Ri Fei.

343
00:27:22,947 --> 00:27:26,042
Your sword doesn't look ordinary either.

344
00:27:27,965 --> 00:27:29,365
You know it?

345
00:27:29,365 --> 00:27:31,765
If I'm not mistaken,

346
00:27:33,581 --> 00:27:36,565
it was forged by the famous smith,
Zhang Ya Jiu.

347
00:27:36,565 --> 00:27:38,632
It's called the Yanling Sword.

348
00:27:42,885 --> 00:27:45,865
Linglong Manor is known to many,

349
00:27:45,865 --> 00:27:47,665
but few know that

350
00:27:47,665 --> 00:27:50,098
the Huo family were sword smiths.

351
00:27:50,098 --> 00:27:52,232
They built Huo's name on metallurgy,

352
00:27:52,232 --> 00:27:54,298
and studied weapons extensively.

353
00:27:54,298 --> 00:27:56,591
Our library is filled with ancient texts.

354
00:27:56,591 --> 00:27:57,758
I've loved reading them since childhood.

355
00:27:57,758 --> 00:28:01,281
I could recite every famous weapon in my sleep.

356
00:28:03,885 --> 00:28:06,165
Your Yanling Sword is the easiest to recognize.

357
00:28:06,165 --> 00:28:07,398
Compared to ordinary swords,

358
00:28:07,398 --> 00:28:08,798
it's two inches longer and twice as heavy.

359
00:28:08,798 --> 00:28:10,665
Its inscription is not on the pommel,

360
00:28:10,665 --> 00:28:13,102
[Yanling]
but on the blade itself.

361
00:28:14,165 --> 00:28:15,598
You are truly knowledgeable.

362
00:28:15,598 --> 00:28:17,325
I've learned something new today.

363
00:28:17,325 --> 00:28:18,605
I also know

364
00:28:19,831 --> 00:28:21,005
that this sword

365
00:28:21,005 --> 00:28:22,685
isn't your usual weapon.

366
00:28:23,665 --> 00:28:25,365
Judging by your skills,

367
00:28:25,365 --> 00:28:29,165
a known name, I'd wager.

368
00:28:29,165 --> 00:28:31,698
Carrying such an obscure sword,

369
00:28:31,698 --> 00:28:34,398
you must be hiding who you really are.

370
00:28:35,948 --> 00:28:38,005
I thought we had a tacit agreement

371
00:28:38,005 --> 00:28:39,765
not to ask about who we really are.

372
00:28:40,631 --> 00:28:41,950
Fine.

373
00:28:41,950 --> 00:28:43,433
I won't ask your real name.

374
00:28:43,433 --> 00:28:45,865
But tell me. Why are you hiding?

375
00:28:45,865 --> 00:28:47,665
And why are you hiding?

376
00:28:47,665 --> 00:28:49,365
To avoid Shao Ji Zu.

377
00:28:49,365 --> 00:28:53,015
So those guards were looking for you?

378
00:28:53,698 --> 00:28:55,305
May I ask, what crime did you commit?

379
00:28:55,305 --> 00:28:57,482
I didn't commit any crime.

380
00:28:58,405 --> 00:28:59,685
It's Shao Ji Zu.

381
00:28:59,685 --> 00:29:00,751
He's abusing his power,

382
00:29:00,751 --> 00:29:03,098
using a manhunt as an excuse to come after me.

383
00:29:03,098 --> 00:29:05,298
He even showed my portrait to everyone he met.

384
00:29:05,298 --> 00:29:07,749
So he was holding your portrait.

385
00:29:08,498 --> 00:29:11,565
He even called me a cold-blooded killer.

386
00:29:12,148 --> 00:29:13,582
Who knows what else he'll do

387
00:29:13,582 --> 00:29:15,125
to get what he wants.

388
00:29:15,125 --> 00:29:17,565
You have a grudge against him?

389
00:29:20,765 --> 00:29:22,671
Let's not talk about it.

390
00:29:24,831 --> 00:29:26,513
I heard that Commander Shao

391
00:29:26,513 --> 00:29:28,232
is engaged to the Huo family's daughter.

392
00:29:28,232 --> 00:29:31,165
Isn't he afraid of offending Linglong Manor?

393
00:29:31,165 --> 00:29:33,032
Engaged? Nonsense.

394
00:29:33,032 --> 00:29:35,888
Our eldest Miss isn't engaged to him at all.

395
00:29:39,198 --> 00:29:40,498
The Lord of Xiangyang was the matchmaker.

396
00:29:40,498 --> 00:29:42,798
How could it be false?

397
00:29:42,798 --> 00:29:45,065
I don't care who the matchmaker is.

398
00:29:45,065 --> 00:29:48,400
Even if the Emperor himself stepped in,
that wouldn't count.

399
00:29:52,298 --> 00:29:53,365
I was the one asking questions.

400
00:29:53,365 --> 00:29:55,377
How are you turning it back on me?

401
00:29:57,098 --> 00:29:59,465
I am indeed hiding from an enemy.

402
00:29:59,465 --> 00:30:01,765
But I can't tell you who that enemy is,

403
00:30:01,765 --> 00:30:04,650
or it would put you in grave danger.

404
00:30:06,725 --> 00:30:09,565
I think you're just bragging.

405
00:30:09,565 --> 00:30:13,245
Who would dare provoke the Huo in Xiangzhou?

406
00:30:13,885 --> 00:30:16,831
Since no one dares to offend the Huo family,

407
00:30:16,831 --> 00:30:18,798
why didn't you say who you are

408
00:30:18,798 --> 00:30:20,698
when you were in trouble?

409
00:30:24,972 --> 00:30:27,203
I won't ask you. So don't ask me either.

410
00:30:47,265 --> 00:30:48,598
Innkeeper.

411
00:30:48,598 --> 00:30:50,525
Where is the little boy tied up there?

412
00:30:50,525 --> 00:30:51,622
He was taken away.

413
00:30:51,622 --> 00:30:52,765
Where?

414
00:30:52,765 --> 00:30:54,598
They say he was brought to the county jail

415
00:30:54,598 --> 00:30:56,759
and is being held there.

416
00:30:58,365 --> 00:30:59,898
Ignoring the murder case,

417
00:30:59,898 --> 00:31:01,465
but harassing a little boy,

418
00:31:01,465 --> 00:31:03,665
is this how the guards do their jobs?

419
00:31:03,665 --> 00:31:05,898
You're not a local.

420
00:31:05,898 --> 00:31:07,398
In Xiangzhou,

421
00:31:07,398 --> 00:31:09,098
it's always been like this.

422
00:31:09,098 --> 00:31:11,398
I can't make a single coin.

423
00:31:11,398 --> 00:31:14,965
All I do every day is
carry bodies and bury people.

424
00:31:14,965 --> 00:31:17,307
Is this what you call an inn?

425
00:31:17,307 --> 00:31:18,725
I'm shutting it down.

426
00:31:18,725 --> 00:31:20,865
Shut it down!

427
00:31:20,865 --> 00:31:22,098
I'll sell coffins.

428
00:31:22,098 --> 00:31:23,265
Sell coffins!

429
00:31:23,265 --> 00:31:25,484
I'll sell coffins.

430
00:31:29,672 --> 00:31:32,241
Thank you for what happened just now.

431
00:31:32,965 --> 00:31:34,583
My benefactor.

432
00:31:34,583 --> 00:31:36,484
Take care!

433
00:31:37,285 --> 00:31:38,475
Where are you going?

434
00:31:38,475 --> 00:31:40,165
We could travel together.

435
00:31:40,165 --> 00:31:41,698
Since I have trouble following me,

436
00:31:41,698 --> 00:31:43,432
I'd better not travel with you.

437
00:31:43,432 --> 00:31:46,898
Are you afraid of crossing Shao Ji Zu?

438
00:31:46,898 --> 00:31:49,365
With your skill, what is there to fear?

439
00:31:49,365 --> 00:31:51,603
Wait. You're not afraid.

440
00:31:51,603 --> 00:31:55,265
You risked exposing yourself to help me.

441
00:31:55,265 --> 00:31:57,098
I haven't thanked you yet.

442
00:31:58,265 --> 00:31:59,898
You too.

443
00:31:59,898 --> 00:32:01,165
Though you were on the run,

444
00:32:01,165 --> 00:32:03,798
you still stepped in to save that boy.

445
00:32:03,798 --> 00:32:05,298
It's truly admirable.

446
00:32:05,298 --> 00:32:07,635
Your thanks belong to us both.

447
00:32:09,931 --> 00:32:12,098
By the way, how long have you practiced that?

448
00:32:12,098 --> 00:32:13,598
Even Shao Ji Zu is impressed.

449
00:32:13,598 --> 00:32:15,798
He thought that I was the one who did that.

450
00:32:15,798 --> 00:32:17,285
If I had your skills,

451
00:32:17,285 --> 00:32:20,205
I would have dealt with all the villains.

452
00:32:22,432 --> 00:32:24,245
Which way are you headed?

453
00:32:24,245 --> 00:32:25,465
I'm returning to the capital.

454
00:32:25,465 --> 00:32:26,765
I just found out

455
00:32:26,765 --> 00:32:28,865
that the boy was taken away by the guards.

456
00:32:28,865 --> 00:32:30,098
We could rescue him together,

457
00:32:30,098 --> 00:32:31,851
and then head north.

458
00:32:35,598 --> 00:32:36,831
I have too many enemies.

459
00:32:36,831 --> 00:32:38,232
I'd rather not drag you into my mess.

460
00:32:38,232 --> 00:32:40,565
Shao Ji Zu isn't leaving with his men.

461
00:32:40,565 --> 00:32:43,498
You're more than a match

462
00:32:43,498 --> 00:32:45,432
for that lot of useless lot.

463
00:32:45,432 --> 00:32:46,800
Alright then.

464
00:32:46,800 --> 00:32:49,325
Can't force you.

465
00:32:49,325 --> 00:32:50,885
Let's part ways here.

466
00:32:54,698 --> 00:32:56,501
Wait.

467
00:32:56,501 --> 00:32:58,450
Changed your mind?

468
00:33:00,298 --> 00:33:01,298
That boy

469
00:33:01,298 --> 00:33:03,298
is the only survivor from today.

470
00:33:03,298 --> 00:33:05,598
He's the only one who might know where it is.

471
00:33:05,598 --> 00:33:07,465
The thing Tang and Shengyun both want.

472
00:33:07,465 --> 00:33:08,698
Once you rescue him,

473
00:33:08,698 --> 00:33:10,665
both will pursue you relentlessly.

474
00:33:10,665 --> 00:33:12,548
Be very careful.

475
00:33:13,731 --> 00:33:15,215
I know.

476
00:33:15,898 --> 00:33:17,565
I just couldn't stand by

477
00:33:17,565 --> 00:33:20,381
and watch him fall into danger again.

478
00:33:21,198 --> 00:33:23,165
Though, I'll keep your warning in mind.

479
00:33:23,165 --> 00:33:24,898
I'm not afraid of the Tang Sect.

480
00:33:24,898 --> 00:33:26,098
If their young master knew

481
00:33:26,098 --> 00:33:27,365
his men were doing this to me,

482
00:33:27,365 --> 00:33:28,965
they'd die.

483
00:33:28,965 --> 00:33:30,898
As for Shengyun Stronghold,

484
00:33:30,898 --> 00:33:32,946
I'll just win or run.

485
00:33:35,232 --> 00:33:36,831
Your lightness skill is superb.

486
00:33:36,831 --> 00:33:38,565
Keep your wits about you,

487
00:33:38,565 --> 00:33:40,631
and you'll win.

488
00:33:42,032 --> 00:33:44,006
See you.

489
00:33:44,006 --> 00:33:46,685
Wish you a swift end to your troubles.

490
00:33:46,685 --> 00:33:48,845
See you in the capital.

491
00:34:08,565 --> 00:34:10,765
Hurry up! Stop dawdling.

492
00:34:10,765 --> 00:34:12,750
Or we won't reach the county by nightfall.

493
00:34:21,498 --> 00:34:23,498
Hey, you. Are you blind?

494
00:34:23,498 --> 00:34:25,231
Can't you see me on duty?

495
00:34:25,231 --> 00:34:27,942
Get out of the way!

496
00:34:30,665 --> 00:34:31,765
Who are you?

497
00:34:31,765 --> 00:34:33,575
What do you want?

498
00:34:35,343 --> 00:34:37,231
I want something from you.

499
00:34:37,231 --> 00:34:38,465
What is it?

500
00:34:38,465 --> 00:34:40,654
Your head.

501
00:34:54,198 --> 00:34:55,925
That Zhan Ri Fei...

502
00:34:55,925 --> 00:34:58,065
He didn't really mean it

503
00:34:58,065 --> 00:34:59,965
about my skill.

504
00:34:59,965 --> 00:35:01,965
He was afraid I'd slow him down.

505
00:35:01,965 --> 00:35:04,365
That's why he wouldn't travel with me.

506
00:35:26,598 --> 00:35:30,483
Everyone in Hanshui Palace is punished.

507
00:35:37,398 --> 00:35:38,665
We are here

508
00:35:38,665 --> 00:35:40,498
to take you back.

509
00:35:40,498 --> 00:35:42,265
Tell me.

510
00:35:42,265 --> 00:35:43,598
About that secret,

511
00:35:43,598 --> 00:35:45,367
have you told it to anyone else?

512
00:35:46,325 --> 00:35:48,298
True, you can't speak,

513
00:35:48,298 --> 00:35:51,239
but if you wanted to get a message across,
you'd find a way,

514
00:35:51,239 --> 00:35:52,664
wouldn't you?

515
00:35:53,781 --> 00:35:55,764
You really haven't told anyone?

516
00:35:58,098 --> 00:36:00,068
People from Hanshui Palace.

517
00:36:06,647 --> 00:36:09,335
You haven't had your medicine in some time.

518
00:36:09,335 --> 00:36:12,325
This dose looks larger than usual.

519
00:36:12,325 --> 00:36:14,745
Just be a bit more painful.

520
00:36:27,125 --> 00:36:29,085
If you don't drink it,

521
00:36:29,085 --> 00:36:30,898
Granny will be very angry.

522
00:36:30,898 --> 00:36:32,065
You know her.

523
00:36:32,065 --> 00:36:33,265
She has many ways

524
00:36:33,265 --> 00:36:35,531
to make you wish you were dead.

525
00:36:39,231 --> 00:36:41,298
A single drop less, and it's worthless.

526
00:36:41,298 --> 00:36:43,165
You're wasting time on purpose.

527
00:36:43,165 --> 00:36:45,445
I'll brew another one.

528
00:36:48,870 --> 00:36:50,078
When did you get here?

529
00:36:50,078 --> 00:36:52,631
- Just now.
- How is that possible?

530
00:36:52,631 --> 00:36:54,231
I have The Silent World Within Earshot.

531
00:36:54,231 --> 00:36:57,465
I can hear every sound within a hundred paces.

532
00:36:57,465 --> 00:36:59,645
Too much focus on one thing made you miss it.

533
00:36:59,645 --> 00:37:02,405
I came here to ask you for a favor.

534
00:37:02,405 --> 00:37:04,845
Me? What could I help you with?

535
00:37:04,845 --> 00:37:06,464
There's a man stuck to me like glue.

536
00:37:06,464 --> 00:37:07,923
I can't shake him off.

537
00:37:07,923 --> 00:37:09,765
I need your help.

538
00:37:09,765 --> 00:37:10,965
If you can't shake him off,

539
00:37:10,965 --> 00:37:11,998
how formidable is he?

540
00:37:11,998 --> 00:37:13,498
Yan Zi Qing of the Yunying Sect.

541
00:37:15,331 --> 00:37:16,398
No wonder.

542
00:37:16,398 --> 00:37:18,698
His lightness skill is indeed extraordinary.

543
00:37:18,698 --> 00:37:19,965
But with your skills,

544
00:37:19,965 --> 00:37:21,198
you worried about him?

545
00:37:21,198 --> 00:37:24,832
Not as much as your Fleeting Glimpse.

546
00:37:24,832 --> 00:37:26,492
I owe you one.

547
00:37:28,165 --> 00:37:29,261
Okay.

548
00:37:29,261 --> 00:37:32,265
Let me rescue the little mute first.

549
00:37:32,265 --> 00:37:33,765
You help me deal with that man.

550
00:37:33,765 --> 00:37:35,265
I help you with this.

551
00:37:35,265 --> 00:37:37,498
I'll rescue the little mute. A fair trade.

552
00:37:37,498 --> 00:37:39,348
We'll be even.

553
00:37:40,405 --> 00:37:41,940
It's a deal.

554
00:37:41,940 --> 00:37:44,032
But the people of Hanshui Palace
have strange skills.

555
00:37:44,032 --> 00:37:45,898
Their weapons are varied and complex.
Be extremely careful.

556
00:37:45,898 --> 00:37:48,881
- I'll keep that in mind.
- Meet me here once it's done.

557
00:37:58,032 --> 00:37:59,371
Who's there?

558
00:38:01,065 --> 00:38:02,631
Using such methods

559
00:38:02,631 --> 00:38:05,304
to deal with a defenseless child,

560
00:38:05,965 --> 00:38:08,906
aren't you afraid
of bringing shame to Hanshui Palace?

561
00:38:09,832 --> 00:38:11,965
Since you know Hanshui Palace,

562
00:38:11,965 --> 00:38:14,605
don't meddle in our affairs.

563
00:38:14,605 --> 00:38:17,165
What a poison that makes you pray for death.

564
00:38:17,165 --> 00:38:18,631
Good one.

565
00:38:18,631 --> 00:38:20,032
If you don't want to drink it,

566
00:38:20,032 --> 00:38:21,265
leave it,

567
00:38:21,265 --> 00:38:23,924
and no need to return to Hanshui Palace.

568
00:38:26,165 --> 00:38:27,832
Love Longing.

569
00:38:27,832 --> 00:38:31,041
[Moon Envoy, from Hanshui Palace]
You must be the Moon Envoy.

570
00:38:31,708 --> 00:38:33,098
Longing leaves no mark and cuts to the bone.

571
00:38:33,098 --> 00:38:35,524
It's not too late for you to leave now.

572
00:38:37,465 --> 00:38:40,198
Carrying Piercing Sun Saber,

573
00:38:40,198 --> 00:38:42,485
[Sun Envoy, from Hanshui Palace]
you must be the Sun Envoy.

574
00:38:42,485 --> 00:38:44,165
Aren't you two

575
00:38:44,165 --> 00:38:45,265
coming at me together?

576
00:38:45,265 --> 00:38:47,307
One's enough.

577
00:39:26,365 --> 00:39:27,432
No matter how sharp the sword,

578
00:39:27,432 --> 00:39:28,898
it can't sever my Love Longing.

579
00:39:28,898 --> 00:39:31,843
Moon Envoy, you live up to your name.

580
00:40:41,665 --> 00:40:43,917
You were hurt badly before this.

581
00:40:43,917 --> 00:40:45,765
In that case,

582
00:40:45,765 --> 00:40:47,333
I'm afraid you

583
00:40:47,333 --> 00:40:50,466
won't leave here alive today.

584
00:40:51,845 --> 00:40:54,498
We are no match for him.

585
00:40:54,498 --> 00:40:55,767
What a joke.

586
00:40:55,767 --> 00:40:57,325
A dying man...

587
00:40:57,325 --> 00:40:59,405
How powerful can he be?

588
00:41:00,205 --> 00:41:04,565
I only need one move to kill anyone.

589
00:42:08,898 --> 00:42:11,165
With wounds like that,

590
00:42:11,165 --> 00:42:14,865
you took on my Dragon-Slaying Coil?

591
00:42:14,865 --> 00:42:17,432
Even if I am wounded,

592
00:42:17,432 --> 00:42:19,600
I can still defeat you.

593
00:42:20,598 --> 00:42:22,832
You can try and see

594
00:42:22,832 --> 00:42:25,916
if you can show another move.

595
00:42:37,565 --> 00:42:39,165
He's badly wounded.

596
00:42:39,165 --> 00:42:40,626
He won't last much longer.

597
00:42:40,626 --> 00:42:42,245
Together, now.

598
00:42:42,245 --> 00:42:44,525
We can take him.

599
00:42:46,365 --> 00:42:47,498
Even so,

600
00:42:47,498 --> 00:42:49,775
I still see no chance of winning.

601
00:42:51,005 --> 00:42:53,632
We will meet again.

